  "goodToKnow": "Die Finsternis is darkness, a literary or biblical word: Und Gott schied das Licht von der Finsternis. Its main everyday use is in die Sonnenfinsternis (solar eclipse) and die Mondfinsternis (lunar eclipse). The last total solar eclipse visible in Germany was on 11 August 1999; the next one won't come until 2081. Finster means dark or sinister: ein finsterer Blick. Plural: die Finsternisse."
